        rdfs:comment                   "Textile, brocaded silk scarf or waistcloth, Varanasi, ca. 1855"@en , "The complete object would have been intended for use as a garment, clothing."@en , "Garment, scarf or waistcloth, green muslin, woven with a small regular motif in gold-wrapped thread, two deep hems of a regular brocaded motif and geometric designs in gold-wrapped thread, borders of gold-wrapped thread in chevron designs, gold fringes at the end. Complete piece."@en ;
